### List projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects?name=web&sort=name,asc
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get a project
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Create a project
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Website"
}
